#. module: fsm_product_category_flag
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fsm_product_category_flag.field_product_category__is_fsm_product
msgid ""
"If enabled, products in this category are considered FSM products and their "
"sales order lines are included in FSM-related revenue calculations such as "
"FSM job profitability."
